\end{claim}

We postpone the proof of \Cref{cl: balls} to after the present one (see also \Cref{fig: figure-7}).
Fix an arbitrary $i\in[N]$. Applying \Cref{lem: two.balls} $M$ times successively using the balls stemming from \Cref{cl: balls} and $z_m^i$ in place of $\omega$, we obtain $M$ Lipschitz-continuous invertible flow maps $\psi_m^i:\mathbb{S}^{d-1}\to\mathbb{S}^{d-1}$ of \eqref{eq: neural.ode.sphere} corresponding to constant parameters, such that, setting
